
# `location` is the universal whereabouts belief label: {X location Y} reads
# "X is/was at place Y" for both props (the building/space a prop sits in) and
# people (the dated where-were-you memory). The explicit (tar ?) keeps the state
# target UNCONSTRAINED - a location may be a building, a room/space, an exterior
# address-space, or a mental org object.
location (+ obs) (tar ?)

# env_point: nav waypoints / spawnpoints (the env_point.arc archetype). Renamed
# from the old `location` archetype/kind so the `location` name is reserved for
# the whereabouts belief-label above and the space-as-location model (exterior
# spaces are `space` entities, not env_points). Dormant in hsim - GrymEngine
# runtime nav/spawn instantiates these.
env_point (+ obs)
    waypoint
    spawnpoint
